    assume: 'teams often assume backups work because jobs report success; assume no tested restore, no rollback for schema changes and no defined RTO/RPO until stated.',
    method: 'classify each system by RTO and RPO, check backup frequency and location against RPO and restore time against RTO, design releases as reversible stages with health gates, sequence schema changes so old and new code both work, then require periodic restore and failover exercises.',
