    methods: ['Applicability scoping by jurisdiction, sector, role and use', 'Obligation-to-control-to-evidence register', 'AI use inventory and risk categorisation flags', 'Framework crosswalk (AI RMF functions, management-system clauses)', 'Audit evidence quality check'],
